# Invite links carry the code as a path segment (/join/AB3XZ9). Serve the landing page for
# any of them rather than 404ing; the page reads the code out of the URL itself.
# Target is extension-less (join-landing, not join.html) on purpose — see _headers. Cloudflare
# Pages' clean-URL redirect for *.html files collapses the rewrite target back down to a path
# that either re-matches this same wildcard (silently drops the rule as a "loop") or, if it
# doesn't re-match, still redirects the browser there and strips the invite code the visitor
# actually requested. An extension-less target isn't clean-URL-redirected, so neither happens.
/join/*  /join-landing  200
/join    /join-landing  200
